        {
          "text": " Konye nakeanyunia ŋesi epote Iparisayon ka Isadukayon luipu aibatisao, kolimok kes ebe, “Yes aur naka imusagan, iŋai bo kiikwenyari yes akerit anyunyura naebunit? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.3.7",
