        },
        {
          "text": " kwabo siriwomito kotauonokus ebe, ‘Ejai oni Aburaam papaawok’: naarai kalimokini yes ebe epedori Edeke aitonyoikin Aburaam idwe kotoma amoru kanu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
